 Project Repository Structure

The complete SQL scripts are organized into the following logical sections within this repository:
 `1_schema_design.sql`: Data Definition Language (DDL) script initializing the database structure.
 `2_data_population.sql`: Data Manipulation Language (DML) script containing mock dataset generation and inserts.
 `3_analysis_queries.sql`: Analytical portfolio queries solving key business operations questions.
